Laranex Schema Viewer for Node.js is licensed under the MIT License.

The viewer it serves is the prebuilt dist/viewer of Laranex Schema Viewer UI
(laranex-schema-viewer-ui, https://github.com/laranex/schema-viewer-ui), MIT
licensed, installed as an npm dependency and not copied into this package. Its
NOTICE lists the fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1), elkjs (Eclipse Public
License 2.0) and other bundled packages.

The laranex-schema contract (validation, canonical JSON, revisions and the
graph builder) is also used from laranex-schema-viewer-ui, not duplicated.

The read-only MCP query layer is a port of python-schema-viewer's query.py and
mcp.py (MIT, Copyright (c) Laranex). tests/fixtures/conformance/documents
contains contract fixtures from laranex-schema-viewer-ui (MIT).
